@startuml
title Output & Integration Layer Sequence Diagram

actor "Dashboard UI" as UI
participant "Agents-api" as AgentsAPI
database "DB" as AlertsDB
actor "ServiceNow (Ticketing System)" as TicketingSystem

UI -> AgentsAPI: Request alerts and recommendations
AgentsAPI -> AlertsDB: Query stored alerts
AlertsDB --> AgentsAPI: Return alerts data
AgentsAPI --> UI: Send alerts with severity, explanation, actions

alt Automated ticketing
  AgentsAPI -> TicketingSystem: Create incident (future use)
end

@enduml

